OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785338294
OL,3,CCoffin rescued from burning 164-year-
OL,4,Cold church by firefighters
OL,6,FA coffin containing a body ready for a
OL,7,Ffuneral service was rescued from a
OL,8,Flarge fire at a Leicester church that
OL,9,Fis more than 160 years old.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to St
OL,12,FAndrew's Church in Jarrom Street at
OL,13,F11:17pm on Tuesday (July 28th).
OL,15,FLeicestershire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,16,Fsaid the roof of the church had been
OL,17,F"severely damaged" while crews from
OL,18,Fseven fire stations attended to tackle
OL,19,Fthe large blaze overnight.
OL,26,@yD@AOUyD@RO]
