PN,34202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785338294
OL,3,CCoffin rescued from burning 164-year-
OL,4,Cold church by firefighters
OL,6,FThe fire service added there have been
OL,7,Fno casualties and people living nearby
OL,8,Fhave been asked to keep windows and
OL,9,Fdoors shut.
OL,11,FA coffin containing a body, left in
OL,12,Fthe church overnight ready for a
OL,13,Ffuneral service this morning, was
OL,14,Fretrieved and moved to safety by our
OL,15,FFirefighters using breathing apparatus.
OL,17,FLeicestershire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,18,Fsaid they recieved multiple calls
OL,19,Fbefore midnight about the large fire.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785338294
OL,3,CCoffin rescued from burning 164-year-
OL,4,Cold church by firefighters
OL,6,FAll persons have been accounted for,
OL,7,Fbut the roof of this 160-year-old
OL,8,Fplace of worship has been severely
OL,9,Fdamaged by the fire.
OL,11,FThe fire service have been working
OL,12,Fwith Leicestershire Police, and with
OL,13,FCadent and Western Power to isolate
OL,14,Fgas and electricity supplies, and
OL,15,Fseveral roads in the vicinity are
OL,16,Fcurrently closed to traffic.
OL,18,FThe cause of the fire is not yet
OL,19,Fknown. Crews will return at 3pm on
OL,20,FWednesday (July 29th) to reinspect for
OL,21,Fhot spots.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
