OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785338294
OL,3,CCoffin rescued from burning 164-year-
OL,4,Cold church by firefighters
OL,6,FThe church, which is an Anglo-Catholic
OL,7,Fparish church, was built by Sir George
OL,8,FGilbert Scott in 1862 from patterned
OL,9,Fred brick and vitrified headers, which
OL,10,Fare brick ends, according to the
OL,11,Fchurch website.
OL,13,FThe Diocese of Leicester has thanked
OL,14,Fthe emergency services and that
OL,15,Fthey're waiting for further
OL,16,Finformation regarding the fire.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785338294
OL,3,CCoffin rescued from burning 164-year-
OL,4,Cold church by firefighters
OL,6,FIn a statement they said: "We are
OL,7,Fdeeply saddened by the fire at St
OL,8,FAndrew's Church in Jarrom Street and
OL,9,Four immediate concern is for the
OL,10,Fsafety and wellbeing of everyone
OL,11,Faffected.
OL,13,F"We are grateful to the emergency
OL,14,Fservices for their swift response, and
OL,15,Fwe thank them for all they are doing.
OL,26,@nD@[OU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/6
