OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785338294
OL,3,CCoffin rescued from burning 164-year-
OL,4,Cold church by firefighters
OL,6,F"At this stage, we are awaiting
OL,7,Ffurther information from
OL,8,FLeicestershire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,9,Fand would ask people not to speculate
OL,10,Fabout the cause of the fire until the
OL,11,Ffacts are known.
OL,13,F"Due to the incident, the funeral that
OL,14,Fwas due to take place at the church
OL,15,Ftoday has been relocated. The family
OL,16,Fand those attending have been informed
OL,17,Fof the alternative arrangements.
OL,19,F"We appreciate the support and
OL,20,Funderstanding of the community at this
OL,21,Fdifficult time."
OL,26,@}D@PO]
